5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited for this! I want to make sure we can actually help these companies grow without getting bogged down. Let's dive in!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to be here. I believe we should be cautious and look closely at the actual stability of the business models.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's make this interesting, shall we? I'm curious about how we're actually managing our resources behind the scenes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know how the numbers work! If we add a new company, I don't want our end-of-quarter to be a scary nightmare again!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree we need a logical approach. I'm particularly concerned about the timeline from investment to actual deployment. We can't afford more delays.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, you're always so serious! But you're right. I'll check on the people side of things to see who's available.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,Experience teaches us that the narrative often masks the reality. I intend to look at the customer retention data.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, you're so focused on the clock! I'm more interested in the money trail and what we can lean on later.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to look for the secrets! I want to see if the numbers they tell us are actually true or just pretend!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, the clock is what determines our ROI. If the money is there but the product isn't live, we're just wasting time.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
