35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, I found some really interesting stuff! It looks like we might have a bit of a bottleneck with some specific roles!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,George,,The data is quite revealing. It seems our successes are more tied to boring back-office tools than the flashy stories we tell.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Oh, this is just delightful. It seems we've been far more generous with our reserves than we thought. We're leaking cash!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,I found out something scary! Some companies just tell us numbers and we have to believe them! That's how the nightmare starts!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,My findings confirm my fears. The security reviews for regulated industries are a massive bottleneck. We need to avoid that trap.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, does that mean we should avoid the high-security ones? I just don't want us spending all our time on paperwork!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,George,,"@Mio, paperwork is a nuisance, but losing customers is a disaster. We must prioritize those who can actually keep their users.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, you're talking about users, but I'm talking about the bank! If we keep this up, we'll be broke before the next round!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, if we can't check the numbers, the bank doesn't matter! We need a company that's easy to count! No more scary audits!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Mio, exactly. If we pick a company in a highly regulated sector, we're signing up for a nine-month delay before a single customer switches on.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm worried about the people! We have advisers who are just sitting there, but the partners are totally overwhelmed!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,George,,"I've noticed a pattern. The companies that survive are the ones that are indispensable, not the ones that are ""innovative.""","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,I'm looking at our credit line and it's a joke. We can't borrow against the things we actually have. We're trapped!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I want a company that doesn't need a fancy outside person to come and say ""yes, this is real"" every three months!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,We need to be realistic. We can't support another company that requires heavy partner involvement if the board seats are already full.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,Let's just make sure we pick someone who doesn't need us to find them ten new managers by next Tuesday!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,George,,I will stand by the data. Stability over hype. That is the only way to ensure we don't have another write-off.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"I'll play along for now, but if we pick a cash-hungry monster, I'm going to be very vocal about it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for the one that's easy to check! I want my weekends back!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll weigh the deployment speed against the partner capacity. We need a path of least resistance for this quarter.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
