60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I like Fabric Loop! It sounds fun and energetic, and I think we can find people for that!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,George,,I am leaning toward Ledger Bridge or Clinic Scheduler. They are the types of back-office tools that actually hold their value.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Fabric Loop sounds like a money pit with those sorting facilities. I'm looking for something lean. Ledger Bridge is my pick.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,No way to Fabric Loop! They have facilities! That means outside appraisals and scary audits! I want Ledger Bridge!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Clinic Scheduler is a trap. Medical records mean a security review that will take three quarters. I cannot support that.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, if Clinic Scheduler is a no, what about Harvest Sensor? It's outdoorsy! That sounds like a fresh start!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,George,,"@Mio, Harvest Sensor is a seasonal subscription. That's a risky revenue model. I prefer the stability of the clinic software.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@George, you're ignoring the security review issue Mizuki mentioned. Ledger Bridge is the only one that's lean and fast.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, Harvest Sensor has sensors in the field! That's more things to count and more people to pay to check them! No!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, the stability of Clinic Scheduler is an illusion if the product can't be deployed for nine months. Ledger Bridge is the logical choice.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"Oh man, everyone is against my fun ideas! But I guess if Ledger Bridge is the fastest to get going, I'm in!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,George,,"I still have a fondness for the clinic model, but I cannot ignore the consensus on deployment speed. I will concede.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"Finally, we're all on the same page. Let's pick the one that won't drain our reserves in a week.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! Ledger Bridge is just software! We can see the numbers on the screen and we don't have to go to a warehouse!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,It's the only option that avoids both the security bottleneck and the partner board seat overload. It's the most efficient path.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,Yay! Let's do it! I'll go tell everyone the good news!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,George,,A sensible decision. It is better to be boring and profitable than exciting and bankrupt.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I'll take it. At least we aren't buying a fleet of trucks for a clothing company.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,I'm so happy! No more scary audit fortnights for me!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,The logic holds. Let's proceed with the vote.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
